{"page_id": "parsebench_docs-0db5d4ae_docs_layout_orbia_impact_report_2024_1_p34-p1", "markdown": "Message From Our Chairman and CEO\n\nWe Are Orbia\n\n2024: A Year In Review\n\nSustainability at Orbia\n\nSustainability\n\nReporting\n\nData\n\nSummary\n\nThe Targets Driving Our Impact\n\n2025 Goals\n\nSafety\n\nWaste\n\nEnviromental Management\n\nAir Emissions\n\n- Baseline\n- Performance in 2024\n\n- Baseline\n- Performance in 2024\n\n2030 Goals\n\nClimate Change\n\nSCIENCE BASED TARGETS\n\nCPPHAI CVMIACON\n\n2050 Goals\n\n- Goal covers categories 11 (use phase) and 12 (end of life), which represent around 87% of our Scope 3 footprint. We achieved a 33% reduction in Scope 3 GHG emissions from 2019, exceeding our target ahead of the 2030 deadline. This milestone reflects the impact of our efforts, though we recognize that market conditions also played a role. We remain committed to improving our low-GWP portfolio and Scope 3 performance to ensure sustained progress.\n- * Orbia adopts the zero-waste-to-landfill definition as sending no more than 10% of total hazardous and non hazardous waste to landfills.\n\nClimate Change\n\nSafety\n\nTotal Recordable Incident Rate\n\n(TRIR) below 0.47 for employees and contractors and 0.2 in thee mid-term\n\n• Baseline\n\nPerformance in 2024\n\nEnviromental Management\n\n100% of sites certified with an environmental management system\n\nScope I and 2 Emissions\n\nReduce absolute Scope 1 and 2 GHG emissions by 47%\n\nScope I and 2 Emissions\n\nAchieve net zero carbon emissions\n\n0.71\n\n55% (70/127 sites)\n\n58% (72/124 sites)\n\n-26%\n\n2024 Performance\n\nKtons\n\nCOz\n\n2019\n\nBaseline\n\n-47%\n\n2030\n\nTarget\n\n-26%\n\n2024 Performance\n\nKtons\n\nCOz\n\n2019\n\nBaseline\n\nnet\n\nzero\n\n2050\n\nTarget\n\nWaste\n\n100% of plants will send Zero Waste to Landfill**\n\nPerformance in 2024\n\nAir Emissions\n\nReduce sulfur oxides (SOx)\n\nemissions by 60%\n\nScope 3 Emissions\n\nReduce absolute Scope 3 GHG\n\nemissions from use and end-of-life treatment of sold products by 30%*\n\n89%\n\n1,355\n\nTons\n\n258\n\nlons\n\n（-81% vS.2018）\n\n-33%\n\n2024 Performance\n\nKtons\n\nCOz\n\n2019\n\nBaseline\n\n-30%\n\n2030\n\nTarget\n\nNotes\n\nIn 2022, the Science Based Targets initiative (SBTI) validated Orbia's near-term Scope 1, 2 and 3 emissions reduction targets.\n\n2019 is the baseline year for all our goals, except SOx emissions, which is 2018, due to a one-month planned shutdown for maintenance in 2019.\n\nOrbia 2024 Impact Report | 34\n\norbia", "width": 2339, "height": 1654, "blocks": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Message From Our Chairman and CEO", "bbox": {"x": 292.80559629315167, "y": 58.57916664688831, "width": 199.79675994108985, "height": 44.795833333333356}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "We Are Orbia", "bbox": {"x": 578.5764963883469, "y": 58.32214932701242, "width": 79.44193021889468, "height": 45.287263594071085}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "2024: A Year In Review", "bbox": {"x": 774.9610277765369, "y": 58.23236459578947, "width": 137.95548324135515, "height": 45.463274256388324}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Sustainability at Orbia", "bbox": {"x": 988.0706672727424, "y": 52.1569139720737, "width": 156.23482751354732, "height": 52.66092090408005}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Sustainability", "bbox": {"x": 1216.0044188362788, "y": 55.13333313232636, "width": 151.56995581737849, "height": 24.12083333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Reporting", "bbox": {"x": 1236.6335283368082, "y": 82.51798175894335, "width": 110.31173681896817, "height": 24.484869015216717}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Data", "bbox": {"x": 1488.1413841735086, "y": 58.5791665805208, "width": 58.56111929307811, "height": 20.67500000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Summary", "bbox": {"x": 1463.6792104401773, "y": 83.84593015307308, "width": 107.48074377338021, "height": 21.956425185998196}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The Targets Driving Our Impact", "bbox": {"x": 144.68041212327856, "y": 251.5458333151236, "width": 685.50